the field will be converted to Seeds of Deceit, and any Lunar-Bloom reactions triggered by nearby characters in the following 15s that would create Dendro Cores or Bountiful Cores will instead create Seeds of Deceit. Seeds of Deceit cannot trigger Hyperbloom or Burgeon reactions and will not burst.\\nWhen Nefer unleashes a Charged Attack or {LINK#N11220002}<color=#FFD780FF>Phantasm Performance</color>{/LINK}, she can absorb Seeds of Deceit within a certain range, gaining 1 stack of {LINK#N11220003}<color=#FFD780FF>Veil of Falsehood</color>{/LINK} for every seed absorbed. When this effect reaches 3 stacks, or when the third stack's duration is refreshed, Nefer's Elemental Mastery will be increased by 100 for 8s.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_05","effects":["N11220002","N11220003"],"linkedConstellations":{"isLevelIncluded":false,"prop":[{"id":1,"type":"normal"}]}},"5":{"skillId":12222,"type":2,"name":"Daughter of the Dust and Sand","description":"When Nefer is in the {LINK#N11220001}<color=#FFD780FF>Shadow Dance</color>{/LINK} state, for 5s after a party member triggers a Lunar-Bloom reaction, Nefer's <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11221}Slither{/LINK}</color> state will provide additional {LINK#N11190008}<color=#FFD780FF>Verdant Dew</color>{/LINK}. Every 100 points of Nefer's Elemental Mastery beyond 500 will strengthen this additional provision effect by 10%. The maximum increase that can be achieved this way is 50%.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_06","effects":["N11220001","N11190008"],"linkedConstellations":null},"6":{"skillId":12223,"type":2,"name":"Moonsign Benediction: Dusklit Eaves","description":"When a party member triggers a Bloom reaction, it will be converted into the Lunar-Bloom reaction, with every point of Elemental Mastery that Nefer has increasing Lunar-Bloom's Base DMG by 0.0175%, up to a maximum of 14%.\\n\\nAdditionally, when Nefer is in the party, the party's <color=#FFD780FF>Moonsign</color> will increase by 1 level.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_07","linkedConstellations":null},"8":{"skillId":12225,"type":2,"name":"Conspiracy of the Golden Vault","description":"Gains 25% more rewards when dispatched on a Nod-Krai Expedition for 20 hours.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_08","linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":1221,"name":"Planning Breeds Success","description":"The Base DMG for Lunar-Bloom reactions caused by Nefer's {LINK#N11220002}<color=#FFD780FF>Phantasm Performance</color>{/LINK} is increased by 60% of her Elemental Mastery. This effect is also boosted by {LINK#N11220003}<color=#FFD780FF>Veil of Falsehood</color>{/LINK}.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_01","effects":["N11220002","N11220003"]},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":1222,"name":"Observation Feeds Strategy","description":"Enhances the effects of the Ascension Talent {LINK#P1222101}<color=#FFD780FF>A Wager of Moonlight</color>{/LINK}: Extends {LINK#N11220003}<color=#FFD780FF>Veil of Falsehood</color>{/LINK}'s duration by 5s, and increases its stack limit to 5, as well as causing {LINK#N11220002}<color=#FFD780FF>Phantasm Performance</color>{/LINK} to deal up to 140% of its original DMG. When Nefer unleashes her Elemental Skill <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11222}Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights{/LINK}</color>, she will instantly gain 2 stacks of Veil of Falsehood. Additionally, when Veil of Falsehood reaches 5 stacks, or when the fifth stack's duration is refreshed, Nefer's Elemental Mastery will be increased by 200 for 8s instead.\\nYou must first unlock the Ascension Talent \"A Wager of Moonlight.\"","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_02","effects":["N11220003","N11220002"]},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":1223,"name":"Deceit Cloaks the Truth","description":"Increases the Level of <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11222}Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights{/LINK}</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Nefer_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":1224,"name":"Delusion Ensnares Reason","description":"When Nefer is on the field and in the {LINK#N11220001}<color=#FFD780FF>Shadow Dance</color>{/LINK} state, you will gain Verdant Dew 25% faster.\\nAdditionally, while Nefer is in the Shadow Dance state, nearby opponents will have their <color=#99FF88FF>Dendro RES</color> decreased by 20%. When Nefer exits the Shadow Dance state or after she strays a certain distance away from the opponents, this effect will be removed after 4.5s.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_03","effects":["N11220001"]},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":1225,"name":"Opportunity Hides in the Margins","description":"Increases the Level of <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11225}Sacred Vow: True Eye's Phantasm{/LINK}</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Nefer_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":1226,"name":"Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides","description":"When Nefer unleashes {LINK#N11220002}<color=#FFD780FF>Phantasm Performance</color>{/LINK}, the second stage of DMG dealt by herself will be converted to deal <color=#99FF88FF>AoE Dendro DMG</color> equal to 85% of her Elemental Mastery. Additionally, when the attacks from Phantasm Performance end, an extra instance of <color=#99FF88FF>AoE Dendro DMG</color> equal to 120% of Nefer's Elemental Mastery will be dealt. All of the aforementioned DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG dealt by Phantasm Performance.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</color>\\nNefer's Lunar-Bloom DMG is {LINK#N11190007}<color=#FFD780FF>elevated</color>{/LINK} by 15%.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Nefer_04","effects":["N11220002","N11190007"],"advancedProps":[{"name":"Converted Phantasm Performance 2-Hit DMG (Nefer)","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"30","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Heavy","horizontalForce":"240","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Extra Lunar-Bloom DMG","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"30","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Heavy","horizontalForce":"140","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]}},"dictionary":{"talent":["N11220001","N11190008","N11220002","N11220003"],"constellation":["N11220002","N11220003","N11220001","N11190007"],"effectsInfo":{"N11220001":{"id":11220001,"name":"Shadow Dance","description":"After using the Elemental Skill <color=#FFD780FF>Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights</color>, Nefer will enter this state.\\nWhile in the Shadow Dance state, if you have at least 1 Verdant Dew, Nefer's Charged Attacks will be replaced with the special Charged Attack Phantasm Performance.\\nNefer will exit the Shadow Dance state when she unleashes {PARAM#P1223201|3S1} Phantasm Performance(s) or the state's duration ends.","params":[{"skillFull":"P1223201|3S1","skillId":1223201,"skillParam":{"paramNum":2,"paramValue":3,"paramMultiplier":1}}],"props":["","","","",""]},"N11190008":{"id":11190008,"name":"Verdant Dew","description":"When party members trigger Lunar-Bloom reactions, the party will receive such a resource.\\nYour party will receive 1 Verdant Dew every 2.5s for 2.5s after triggering a Lunar-Bloom reaction. Your party can have up to 3 Verdant Dew. If you trigger another Lunar-Bloom reaction during this time, the duration of this effect will be reset.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]},"N11220002":{"id":11220002,"name":"Phantasm Performance","description":"When in the Shadow Dance state caused by her Elemental Skill <color=#FFD780FF>Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights</color>, if you have at least 1 Verdant Dew, Nefer's Charged Attacks will be replaced with the special Charged Attack Phantasm Performance, which will not consume Stamina.\\nNefer summons shades of herself to perform Coordinated Attacks against enemies. Nefer and the shades will deal 2 and 3 stages of <color=#99FF88FF>AoE Dendro DMG</color> respectively. DMG dealt by the shades is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG. 1 Verdant Dew will be consumed the first time shades are summoned after every Phantasm Performance.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]},"N11220003":{"id":11220003,"name":"Veil of Falsehood","description":"After absorbing Seeds of Deceit via the Ascension Talent A Wager of Moonlight, Nefer gains this effect, thereby increasing the DMG dealt by her Phantasm Performance.\\nEach stack of Veil of Falsehood increases the DMG dealt by Nefer's Phantasm Performance by {PARAM#P1222101|6S100}%. The initial maximum number of stacks is {PARAM#P1222101|1S1}, with each stack lasting for {PARAM#P1222101|2S1}s (each stack's duration is counted independently).","params":[{"skillFull":"P1222101|6S100","skillId":1222101,"skillParam":{"paramNum":5,"paramValue":0.08,"paramMultiplier":100}},{"skillFull":"P1222101|1S1","skillId":1222101,"skillParam":{"paramNum":0,"paramValue":3,"paramMultiplier":1}},{"skillFull":"P1222101|2S1","skillId":1222101,"skillParam":{"paramNum":1,"paramValue":9,"paramMultiplier":1}}],"props":["","","","",""]},"N11190007":{"id":11190007,"name":"Elevation","description":"Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]}}}}}